                        <div id="page-title">
                            中国分部异常项目
                        </div>
                    

                    

                    



                    <div id="page-content">
                        

<p><strong>前言：</strong>SCP基金会中国分部发现了为数不少的项目无用而不值得进一步关注。本文件列出了那些激起了一些好奇心的项目。如果这些项目的知识在将来变得有用或必要，则可以将其作为一种资源。<br />
— █████博士，Site-CN-██研究主管</p>
<p>欲查看已归档的异常项目记录，请<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn-arc">点击这里</a>。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button create-button" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00484/parentPage/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/#_editpage">添加新的记录</a></p>
</div>
    
    
    
    </div>
<p style="text-align: center;">显示顺序：<a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating%20desc">评分较高</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/rating">评分较低</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name">最早发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/name%20desc">最新发布</a> | <a href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn/order/random">随机</a></p>
<p><strong>提示：</strong>如果你希望改变你的评分，请先点击“X”取消你的评分，再重新评分。</p>
<hr />
<div class="list-pages-box">    <div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00160/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一正常尺寸黑色U盘，容量64G，必须在翻转三次或以上后才能插入USB接口，无论在视觉上接口与U盘是否匹配。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>陕西省██市一电子产品专卖店内，经检查其余商品无异常性质。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>由研究员李██持有<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>买到它时我差点弄坏了电脑接口。——研究员李██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00160" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00160" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00160-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5979701&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608385564" alt="LEAVEN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5979701)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;">LEAVEN</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588772366 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 May 2020 13:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台███牌的电冰箱，在打开时会将周围的室温升高至5█℃。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>201█/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82员工食堂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>申请开设桑拿房。</em>-刚刚检查仓库回来的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>原因？</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
<em>这不仅关系到异常物品的保存，而且关系到我们站点的电费——您能够想象一打开仓库有半个仓库的研究员在用这玩意撒上水蒸桑拿吗？</em>-被一堆研究员拿着记忆删除喷雾追了半个站点的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>拒······批准。</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
-</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00113" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00113-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608385564" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587818740 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 12:45</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00225/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述:</strong>一沓不明活动的奖券，共<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">7</span>5张被刮开后所中的奖品会被奖券生成并落入刮奖者的口袋里。目前最高奖项为W特工开出的iPhone 11 Pro Max。<br />
<strong>回收日期:</strong>20██/██/██。<br />
<strong>回收地点:</strong>Dr.NineTree的工作室中。<br />
<strong>当前状态:</strong>还剩下5张。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong></p>
<blockquote>
<p>诶，我什么时候有的iPhone 11 Pro Max？我发财了！！！ ——特工W</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>老天爷，为什么我是一本《英语速成手册》？我不需要这玩意儿！！！</p>
</blockquote>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00225" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00225" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00225-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentlq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6140401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6140401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608385564" alt="agentLQ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6140401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agentlq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6140401); return false;">agentLQ</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590888895 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">31 May 2020 01:34</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608385564" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1595921948 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Jul 2020 07:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶喷雾式杀虫剂，瓶身商标为“鸵鸟”牌。吸入其喷出气雾的人类将无法通过视觉感知到一切蜚蠊科昆虫的存在，持续时间尚不明确。化验显示该物质并无杀虫功效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██厨师刘██宿舍中。刘██对其来历无清晰记忆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██低危物品储存柜。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>在确认持续时间之前千万别放他回去工作！</em>——██博士</p>
